; ============================================================
;  DNS Zone File for orahdex.app
;  Target: Replit autoscale deployment
;  Replit URL: orahdex.replit.app
;
;  HOW TO USE:
;  1. Import this file into your DNS provider, OR
;     add the records manually one by one.
;  2. Add orahdex.app as a custom domain inside
;     Replit → Deploy → Custom Domains, then copy
;     the TXT verification value Replit gives you
;     and add it as the TXT record below.
;  3. Wait up to 24 h for DNS propagation.
;
;  APEX RECORD NOTE:
;  Standard DNS does not allow a CNAME on the apex (@).
;  Choose one option based on your provider:
;    • Cloudflare  → use CNAME (Cloudflare flattens it automatically)
;    • Route 53    → use ALIAS record pointing to orahdex.replit.app.
;    • Others      → use ANAME/ALIAS if supported, otherwise A records:
;                    A  34.120.54.55   (Replit GCP load balancer)
; ============================================================

$ORIGIN orahdex.app.
$TTL    300

; ── Apex (root domain) ───────────────────────────────────────
; Cloudflare / Route 53 / ALIAS-capable providers:
@                IN  CNAME  orahdex.replit.app.

; Traditional DNS providers (no ALIAS support) — use instead of CNAME above:
; @              IN  A      34.120.54.55

; ── www subdomain ────────────────────────────────────────────
www              IN  CNAME  orahdex.replit.app.

; ── Domain verification (fill in value from Replit) ──────────
; Replit will give you a TXT record value when you add the domain.
; Replace REPLIT_VERIFICATION_VALUE_HERE with that value.
@                IN  TXT    "replit-verify=REPLIT_VERIFICATION_VALUE_HERE"

; ── Email (AWS SES — us-east-1) ──────────────────────────────
; Add these after verifying orahdex.app in AWS SES console.
; SES will give you DKIM CNAME values to add (3 records like below).
;
; MX (SES inbound — only if you want to receive mail):
; @              IN  MX  10  inbound-smtp.us-east-1.amazonaws.com.
;
; SPF (authorise SES to send as @orahdex.app):
@                IN  TXT    "v=spf1 include:amazonses.com ~all"
;
; DKIM — replace TOKEN with values from AWS SES → Identities → orahdex.app → DKIM:
; TOKEN1._domainkey  IN  CNAME  TOKEN1.dkim.amazonses.com.
; TOKEN2._domainkey  IN  CNAME  TOKEN2.dkim.amazonses.com.
; TOKEN3._domainkey  IN  CNAME  TOKEN3.dkim.amazonses.com.
;
; DMARC:
_dmarc           IN  TXT    "v=DMARC1; p=quarantine; rua=mailto:dmarc@orahdex.app"
